tle","title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"يدور العمل حول حميدة (شادية) الفتاة اليتيمة الطامحة للثراء ، تتم خطبتها لحلاق الزقاق عباس الحلو (صلاح قابيل) الذي يقرر السفر ليحصل على مال أكثر ليفي باحتياجات (حميدة) ، بعد سفره يقوم قواد محترف فرج (يوسف شعبان) بإغواء (حميدة) ، وبعد تورطها تنغمس في حياتها الجديدة وتنسى (عباس) وأهل الزقاق ، لتجمعها الصدفة مرة أخرى بـ(عباس) الذي يقرر الانتقام .","description_en":"This film is based on a novel from 1947 by the Nobel Prize winner Naguib Mahfouz. The story takes place during WWII and focuses on Al-Madak Alley, a teeming back street in Cairo which is presented as the microcosm of the world. A barber is in love with a young poor girl, who lives with her mother, and gets a job in an English Army camp to earn enough money for their marriage. But he is not the only one who wants to marry this girl and when the barber returns, she is gone.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQl7q6Bq9f06nx72F2tki27JTFC.jpg","backdrop":null,"has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1963","release_date":"1963-09-21","runtime_minutes":125,"status":"Released","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["دراما"],"genre_keys":["drama"],"similar":["mv936075","mv567","mv1422","mv381284","mv106646","mv872585","mv359724","mv78"],"director":"حسن الإمام","cast":[{"name":"شادية","character":"Hameeda","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/62arY87I83h7Nh2dYSFLvVNOnfB.jpg"},{"name":"صلاح قابيل","character":"Abbas Al-Helou","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ytdoWkLJQcNtcm0v36ygQ6YHZco.jpg"},{"name":"حسن يوسف","character":"Hussein","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jPtJpKZxfOH7Cj2AfxdvHpLMYMx.jpg"},{"name":"يوسف شعبان","character":"Farag","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/svhdm3fdJKkJdG5tCSSYV6Mynju.jpg"},{"name":"سامية جمال","character":"Shukriya","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7oEqOHkig8YMOZUQQ041rNapJ